<title>HONG KONG: RUGBY UNION-FIJI WIN WORLD CUP VS SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-FIJI WIN WORLD CUP VS SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fiji won the World Cup Sevens when they beat South Africa 24-21 in the final on Sunday.</p>
<p>Final score: Fiji 24 South Africa 21 (7-14)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Fiji - Tries: Marika Vunibaka 8th min, Luke Erenavula 12, Lemeki Koroi 14, 15. Conversions: Waisale Serevi 8, 12</p>
<p>South Africa - Tries: Andre Venter 2, 4, Stephen Brink 19. Conversions: Joost van der Westhuizen 2, 4, Brink 19.</p>
</text>
